+// Background blur for translucent pages (overloays basically) the page behind is shrunk,
+// blurred with two box blur passes (close enough to a gaussian) and scaled back
+// up, the blurred copy is kept while the overlay is open, so the page behind it is only blured once
+#define BLUR_DOWNSCALE_SHIFT 1
